1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:06,864
When parents travel on vacation with family or stay in the hospital, daily check-ins aren't needed.

2
00:00:06,864 --> 00:00:17,769
With 'Vacation Mode,' users simply pick start and end dates to pause all countdowns and reminders, letting everyone enjoy their trip without unnecessary notifications.

3
00:00:17,769 --> 00:00:22,601
Regarding privacy, we adhere to strict global privacy standards like GDPR.

4
00:00:22,601 --> 00:00:34,160
If a family ever decides to stop using the service, one tap on 'Erase All Data' permanently removes all personal records from both the device and cloud servers in three seconds.
